  "5229": "Floral Flare Road\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Crimson Rock 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCGround^000000\nDescription: ^777777Creates burning petals in\nthe direction the caster is facing, inflicting\n^FF0000Fire^777777 elemental magic damage to targets.\nwhich enter the targeted area during\nthe skill duration.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600SPL^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777MATK 790%/AoE: 3x3 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777MATK 1530%/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777MATK 2270%/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777MATK 3010%/AoE: 9x9 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777MATK 3750%/AoE: 11x11 cells^000000",
  "5230": "Astral Strike\nMax Level: 10\n^CC3399Requirement: Comet 5, Mystery Illusion 3,\\nDeadly Projection 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active(AP)^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCGround^000000\nAP Cost: ^FF000015^000000\nDescription: ^777777Drops a powerful meteorite on the\nground to inflict ^009999Neutral^777777 elemental\nmagic damage and additional damage over time\nfor 6 seconds. The skill inflicts more damage\nagainst ^00A100Undead^777777 and ^00A100Dragon^777777 race monsters.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600SPL^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777MATK 3300%/3450%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n650%(Secondary)/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777MATK 5900%/6200%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n1300%(Secondary)/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777MATK 8500%/8950%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n1950%(Secondary)/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777MATK 11100%/11700%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n2600%(Secondary)/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777MATK 13700%/14450%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n3250%(Secondary)/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 6]: ^777777MATK 16000%/17200%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n3900%(Secondary)/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 7]: ^777777MATK 18900%/19950%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n4550%(Secondary)/AoE: 9x9 cells^000000\n[Lv 8]: ^777777MATK 21500%/22700%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n5200%(Secondary)/AoE: 9x9 cells^000000\n[Lv 9]: ^777777MATK 24100%/25450%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n5850%(Secondary)/AoE: 9x9 cells^000000\n[Lv 10]: ^777777MATK 26700%/28200%(^00A100Undead/Dragon^777777)/\n6500%(Secondary)/AoE: 11x11 cells^000000",
  "5232": "Climax\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Tetra Vortex 5,\\nTwo-Handed Staff Mastery 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active(AP)^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCCaster^000000\nAP Cost: ^FF0000125^000000\nDescription: ^777777Grants a special effects to certain\nskills for 300 seconds. The effects depends on\n^0000FFClimax^777777 skill level.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Grants Climax Level 1^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777Grants Climax Level 2^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777Grants Climax Level 3^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777Grants Climax Level 4^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777Grants Climax Level 5^000000",
  "5233": "Rock Down\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Stratum Tremor 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Drops a lrage rock on the target\nand inflicts ^CC5500Earth^777777 elemental magic damage\nto the target and nearby targets.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600SPL.^777777\nIf ^0000FFClimax^777777 state is active, the damage\nwill be increased (regardless of ^0000FFClimax^777777 level).^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777MATK 1550%/1850%(^0000FFClimax^777777)\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777MATK 3100%/3700%(^0000FFClimax^777777)\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777MATK 4650%/5550%(^0000FFClimax^777777)\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777MATK 6200%/7400%(^0000FFClimax^777777)\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777MATK 7750%/9250%(^0000FFClimax^777777)\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
  "5234": "Storm Cannon\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Tornado Storm 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Shoots a vortex of wind in a\nstraight line to the target inflicting ^33CC00Wind^777777\nelemental magic damage to the targets in\nit's path. Damage additionally increases\naccording to the caster's ^CC6600Base Level and ^CC6600SPL^777777.\nIf ^0000FFClimax^777777 state is active, the damage\nwill be increased (regardless of ^0000FFClimax^777777 level).^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777MATK 1550%/1850%(^0000FFClimax^777777)^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777MATK 3100%/3700%(^0000FFClimax^777777)^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777MATK 4650%/5550%(^0000FFClimax^777777)^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777MATK 6200%/7400%(^0000FFClimax^777777)^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777MATK 7750%/9250%(^0000FFClimax^777777)^000000",
  "5235": "Crimson Arrow\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Floral Flare Road 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Shoots a fire arrow in a\nstraight line to the target inflicting\n^FF0000Fire^777777 elemental magic damage to\nthe targets in a straight line.\nThe fire arrow then explodes upon impact\ninflicting ^FF0000Fire^777777 elemental magic\ndamage to the target and surrounding enemies.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600SPL^777777.\nIf ^0000FFClimax^777777 state is active, the explosion\nand fire arrow damage will be doubled\n(regardless of ^0000FFClimax^777777 level).^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777MATK 400%/750%(Explosion),\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777MATK 800%/1500%(Explosion),\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777MATK 1200%/2250%(Explosion),\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777MATK 1600%/3000%(Explosion),\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777MATK 2000%/3750%(Explosion),\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
