  "5238": "Powerful Faith\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Will of Waith 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Supportive^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCCaster^000000\nDescription: ^777777Strengthens your faith by\nincreasing the ^CC6600ATK^777777 and ^CC6600P.ATK^777777. Can't be used\ntogether with ^0000FFFirm Faith^777777 and ^0000FFSincere Faith^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK +10, P.ATK +7,\nDuration: 120 seconds^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK +15, P.ATK +9,\nDuration: 150 seconds^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK +20, P.ATK +11,\nDuration: 180 seconds^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK +25, P.ATK +13,\nDuration: 210 seconds^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK +30, P.ATK +15,\nDuration: 240 seconds^000000",
