  "5242": "Sincere Faith\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Will of Faith 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Supportive^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCCaster^000000\nDescription: ^777777Strengthens your faith by\nincreasing the ^CC6600ASPD^777777 and ^CC6600Perfect HIT^777777.\nCan't be used together with\n^0000FFPowerful Faith^777777 and ^0000FFFirm Faith^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ASPD +1, Perfect Hit +4%,\nDuration: 120 seconds^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ASPD +1, Perfect Hit +8%,\nDuration: 150 seconds^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ASPD +2, Perfect Hit +12%,\nDuration: 180 seconds^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ASPD +2, Perfect Hit +16%,\nDuration: 210 seconds^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ASPD +3, Perfect Hit +20%,\nDuration: 240 seconds^000000",
  "5245": "First Brand\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Will of Faith 2^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nDescription: ^777777Inflicts melee physical damage to\na target and surrounding enemies and inflicts\n^0000FFBrand^777777 status.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777,\ncan inflict half of the total ^CC6600Critical Damage^777777\nbased on the caster's ^CC6600Critical^777777 chance.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 450%, Brand Duration: 1 seconds,\nAoE: 3x3 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 900%, Brand Duration: 2 seconds,\nAoE: 3x3 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 1350%, Brand Duration: 3 seconds,\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 1800%, Brand Duration: 4 seconds,\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 2250%, Brand Duration: 5 seconds,\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
