  "5344": "Wooden Warrior\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Creeper 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Summon^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCCaster^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF20^000000\nDescription: ^777777Summons a Wooden Warrior.\nOnly 1 ^0000FFWooden Warrior^777777 can be summoned\nat once. Increases damage of ^0000FFCart Tornado^777777\nand ^0000FFCart Cannon^777777 while summoned.\nConsumes 2 ^990099Greater Plant Bottle^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Duration: 120 seconds^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777Duration: 180 seconds^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777Duration: 240 seconds^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777Duration: 300 seconds^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777Duration: 360 seconds^000000",
