  "5343": "Acidified Zone Fire\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Acidified Zone Ground 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Ranged^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF4 (Lv 1~3), 5 (Lv 4~5)^000000\nDescription: ^777777Inflicts ^FF0000Fire^777777 elemental\nphysical damage 7 times on the target\nand surrounding enemies.\nWhen a player is hit by this skill,\nthere is a low chance that an Acid Zone\nwill appear on the same cell.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.\nConsumes 2 ^990099Flame Acid Bottle^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 400% per Hit/AoE: 3x3 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 800% per Hit/AoE: 3x3 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 1200% per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 1600% per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 2000% per Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
