  "5313": "Strip Shadow\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Divest Accessory 1,\\nDagger & Bow Mastery 7^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Debuff^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nDescription: ^777777Strips all of the target's\n^990099Shadow Equipment^777777 and can't be equipped\nfor the skill duration. Decreases physical and\nmagical resistance when used on monsters.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Strip Chance: 20%, Duration: 60 seconds^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777Strip Chance: 25%, Duration: 70 seconds^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777Strip Chance: 30%, Duration: 80 seconds^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777Strip Chance: 35%, Duration: 90 seconds^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777Strip Chance: 40%, Duration: 100 seconds^000000",
