  "5365": "Magic Book Mastery\nMax Level: 10\nSkill Form: ^6666CCPassive^000000\nDescription: ^777777Increases ^0000BBWater^777777, ^33CC00Wind^777777,\n^CC5500Earth^777777, ^0000FFFire^777777 and ^663399Poison^777777 elemental\nmagic damage when equipped with a ^990099Book^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Damage +1%^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777Damage +2%^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777Damage +3%^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777Damage +4%^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777Damage +5%^000000\n[Lv 6]: ^777777Damage +6%^000000\n[Lv 7]: ^777777Damage +7%^000000\n[Lv 8]: ^777777Damage +8%^000000\n[Lv 9]: ^777777Damage +9%^000000\n[Lv 10]: ^777777Damage +10%^000000",
