  "5379": "Summon Elemental Serpens\nMax Level: 1\n^CC3399Requirement: Summon Aqua 3, Summon Agni 3,\\nSummon Ventus 3, Summon Terra 3,\\nElemental Spirit Mastery 1, Venom Swamp 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Summon^000000\nDescription: ^777777Advents any large Elemental Spirit\ninto ^0000FFSuperior Spirit Serpens^777777.\nUpon summoning, increases ^663399Poison^777777 elemental\nmagic damage by 10% and increases damage\nof ^0000FFVenom Swamp^777777. ^0000FFSerpens^777777's stats increases\nbased on the caster's stats and\n^0000FFElemental Spirit Mastery^777777 skill level.\nConsumes 1 ^990099Poison Stone^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Duration: 1500 seconds^000000",
  "5375": "Summon Elemental Ardor\nMax Level: 1\n^CC3399Requirement: Summon Agni 3,\\nElemental Spirit Mastery 1, Conflagration 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Summon^000000\nDescription: ^777777Advents large Elemental Spirit Agni\ninto ^0000FFSuperior Spirit Ardor^777777.\nUpon summoning, increases ^FF0000Fire^777777 elemental\nmagic damage by 10% and increases damage\nof ^0000FFConflagration^777777. ^0000FFArdor^777777's stats increases\nbased on the caster's stats and\n^0000FFElemental Spirit Mastery^777777 skill level.\nConsumes 1 ^990099Flame Stone^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Duration: 1500 seconds^000000",
  "5378": "Summon Elemental Terremotus\nMax Level: 1\n^CC3399Requirement: Summon Terra 3,\\nElemental Spirit Mastery 1, Terra Drive 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Summon^000000\nDescription: ^777777Advents large Elemental Spirit Terra\ninto ^0000FFSuperior Spirit Terremotus^777777.\nUpon summoning, increases ^CC5500Earth^777777 elemental\nmagic damage by 10% and increases damage\nof ^0000FFTerra Drive^777777. ^0000FFTerremotus^777777' stats increases\nbased on the caster's stats and\n^0000FFElemental Spirit Mastery^777777 skill level.\nConsumes 1 ^990099Earth Stone^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Duration: 1500 seconds^000000",
  "5377": "Summon Elemental Procella\nMax Level: 1\n^CC3399Requirement: Summon Ventus 3,\\nElemental Spirit Mastery 1, Lightning Land 1^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Summon^000000\nDescription: ^777777Advents large Elemental Spirit\nVentus into ^0000FFSuperior Spirit Procella^777777.\nUpon summoning, increases ^33CC00Wind^777777 elemental\nmagic damage by 10% and increases damage\nof ^0000FFLightning Land^777777. ^0000FFProcella^777777's stats increases\nbased on the caster's stats and\n^0000FFElemental Spirit Mastery^777777 skill level.\nConsumes 1 ^990099Lightning Stone^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Duration: 1500 seconds^000000",
