  "5495": "Dark Dragon - Nightmare\nMax Level: 1\n^CC3399Requirement: Mirage 1, Red Flame Cannon 5,\\nCold Blooded Cannon 5, Thundering Cannon 5,\\nGolden Dragon Cannon 5, Darkening Cannon 5^000000\nSkill Form: ^339966Active(AP)^000000\nType: ^FF0000Magical^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCCaster^000000\nCost: ^FF000020^000000\nDescription: ^777777Summons the shadow dragon\nin 11x11 cells around you, to inflict a\npowerful ^009999Shadow^777777 elemental magic damage.\nInflicts additional ^FF0000Fire^777777 elemental magic\ndamage of the same power to the targets\naffected by the ^663399Nightmare^777777 effect\n(The ^663399Nightmare^777777 effect is then canceled).\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600SPL^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777MATK 17500%^000000",
  "784": "RO 20th Anniversary Firecracker\nMax Level: 1\n^CC3399Requirement: Event^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^339900Effect^000000\nTarget: ^6666CCCaster^000000\nDescription: ^777777You can shoot fireworks to celebrate the 20th anniversary of Ragnarok Online.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777Fires fireworks for 3 seconds^000000",
