  "6506": "Rush Strike\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Rush Quake 5^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Rush towards the target and\nstrike it down with your axe,\ninflicting melee physical damage to the target\nand surrounding enemies.\nDamage is additionaly increased according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.\nHowever, it cannot be used while\nriding on an ^990099Mado Gear^777777.\nRequires ^990099Two-Handed Axe^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 4400%/AoE: 3x3 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 8150%/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 11900%/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 15650%/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 19400%/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
