  "6508": "Energy Cannonade\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Triple Laser 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Ranged^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF3^000000\nDescription: ^777777Can only be used while\nriding on an ^990099Mado Gear^777777.\nFires an energy sphere at the target,\ninflicting ranged physical damage 7 times to\nthe target and surrounding enemies.\nIgnores the target's physical defense and\ndamage is additionaly increased according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 1000% per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 1750% per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 2500% per Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 3250% per Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 4000% per Hit/AoE: 9x9 cells^000000",
  "6509": "Mystery Powder\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Explosive Powder 5^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nDescription: ^777777Scatters very small fine powder at the target,\ninflicting melee physical damage to the target and surrounding enemies.\nAdditionally, grants ^0000FFMystery Powder^777777 effect to the caster,\nallowing to use ^0000FFDust Explosion^777777 for 60 seconds.\nDamage is additionaly increased according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 5500%/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 9500%/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 13500%/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 17500%/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 21500%/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
  "6510": "Dust Explosion\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Mystery Powder 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Can be used when ^0000FFMystery Powder^777777\neffect is active. Causes a dust explosion\ntoward the target, inflicting melee physical\ndamage 5 times to the target and surrounding\nenemies. Inflicts more damage when\nunder the ^0000FFResearch Report^777777 effect.\nDamage is additionaly increased according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 1120%/\n1380%(^0000FFResearch Report^777777) per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 1740%/\n2210%(^0000FFResearch Report^777777) per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 2360%/\n3040%(^0000FFResearch Report^777777) per Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 2980%/\n3870%(^0000FFResearch Report^777777) per Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 3600%/\n4700%(^0000FFResearch Report^777777) per Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
  "6511": "Cross Slash\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Weapon Blocking 3,\\nDancing Knife 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Inflicts melee physical damage\n3 times to the target and surrounding enemies.\nGrants ^0000FFWeapon Blocking^777777 status for 10 seconds.\nInflicts more damage when under\nthe ^0000FFShadow Exceed^777777 effect.\nDamage additionally increases according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777,\ncan inflict half of the total ^CC6600Critical Damage^777777\nbased on half of the caster's ^CC6600Critical^777777 chance.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 300%/360%(^0000FFShadow Exceed^777777)\nper Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 600%/720%(^0000FFShadow Exceed^777777)\nper Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 900%/1080%(^0000FFShadow Exceed^777777\nper Hit/AoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 1200%/1440%(^0000FFShadow Exceed^777777)\nper Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 1500%/1800%(^0000FFShadow Exceed^777777)\nper Hit/AoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
  "6512": "Hit And Sliding\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Dagger & Bow Mastery 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Attacks the target, inflicting melee\nphysical damage and then slide backwards.\nIf the equipped weapon is a ^990099Bow^777777,\ninflicts ranged physical damage.\nGrants ^0000FFChasing^777777 effect for 60 seconds.\nDamage is additionaly increased according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 3500%/Slide: 1 cell^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 7000%/Slide: 2 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 10500%/Slide: 3 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 14000%/Slide: 4 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 17500%/Slide: 5 cells^000000\n \n^CC3D3D[Chasing]^777777\nThe damage of the following skills is increased:\n^4641D9[Unlucky Rush]^777777: +(Unlucky Rush Lv x2500)%^000000\n^CC723D[Chain Reaction Shot Secondary Damage]^777777:\n+(Chain Reaction Shot Lv x1100)%^000000",
  "6513": "Chasing Break\nMax Level: 5\n^CC3399Requirement: Hit And Sliding 3^000000\nSkill Form: ^3F0099Active^000000\nType: ^FF0000Physical Melee^000000\nTarget: ^6666CC1 Character^000000\nAP Recovery: ^0054FF2^000000\nDescription: ^777777Chases and charges towards\nthe target, inflicting melee physical damage\nto the target and surrounding enemies 5 times.\nInflicts more damage when under the\n^0000FFChasing^777777 effect and hits 7 times.\nDamage is additionaly increased according\nto the caster's ^CC6600Base Level^777777 and ^CC6600POW^777777.^000000\n[Lv 1]: ^777777ATK 2000%/2250%(^0000FFChasing^777777)\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 2]: ^777777ATK 2450%/2750%(^0000FFChasing^777777)\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 3]: ^777777ATK 2900%/3250%(^0000FFChasing^777777)\nAoE: 5x5 cells^000000\n[Lv 4]: ^777777ATK 3350%/3750%(^0000FFChasing^777777)\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000\n[Lv 5]: ^777777ATK 3800%/4250%(^0000FFChasing^777777)\nAoE: 7x7 cells^000000",
